The gems is "aA".
The stones is "aAAbbbb".
The lastgem is the last position of gems.
The laststone is the last position of stones.
The total is 0.
For every spot from 0 to laststone.
The piece is the slice of stones from spot to spot plus 1.
For every probe from 0 to lastgem.
The jewelpiece is the slice of gems from probe to probe plus 1.
If jewelpiece matches piece, add 1 to total.

Show total.
